'''Giant Cape''' (Japanese: '''大きなマント''' ''Big Cloak'') is a {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Tool
|rule=Pocket Tool
|effect=The Pokémon this card is attached to gets +20 HP.
}}

