==Trivia==
This card's effect is identical to that of the {{TCG|Giant Cape}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].

===Origin===
* This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Dragons Exalted|Giant Cape|114}} from the {{TCG|Dragons Exalted}} expansion.

